{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "525a924f-212f-8344-a08f-d38f697de540",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T13:42:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Min-jun Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:39:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, this is Min-jun Haddad. I'm at 414 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. I got my water and sewer bill and, hmm, let me see, it's just not right. Well, a few things. Let me start over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So first, the mailing address on it is wrong. It's going to the old place and I never see it. I want to change that. And actually, can I just go paperless? Forget the mail altogether."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, we can do both. What's the new mailing address you want on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:39:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, okay, actually, it's the same house, just a PO box now. Hold on, let me think. No, no, I'd rather it go to the house. Four-fourteen Chapel. Just make it go to the house, and then paperless on top of that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so mailing address is the house, 414 Chapel Street, and we'll flag the account for paperless billing. You'll get the bills by email instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And can you send me a duplicate of this one by email? The current one. Since I never got the paper copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I can do that. Is the email on file still good, or do you want a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, let me see. Use the one on file. Actually, no, can you read it back to me? [pause] Sorry, I'm sweeping the kitchen, hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I hear you in the background."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sorry, the broom just thumped the wall. Okay. I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:40:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All good. I'll read you the email on the account. It matches what you gave us when you set it up, so I'm sending it there now. Check your inbox in a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's the right one. Good. So the other thing, the actual reason I'm annoyed. The usage on this bill is way higher than normal. Like double. Nobody's home all day half the week. I want the meter read re-checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So the bill is based on the reading from the meter, in hundred cubic feet. If the number jumped, it could be a misread, an estimate, or a leak on your side. I can put in a request for a re-read and a crew will go check the meter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:41:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, yes, do that. A re-read. I don't think it's a leak, I'd have seen water somewhere. Well, I mean, I looked at the toilet already, and nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:41:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good thing to check. After the re-read, if the number's off, we can look at adjusting the bill. Is there a good time, or does someone need to be home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the meter's in the basement, so, I guess someone has to be home. I work from the house mostly. Any weekday is okay. Or, hmm, no, mornings are better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:42:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, weekday mornings. They'll call you before they come. Is 401-555-0193 the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:42:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:42:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So to recap: mailing address set to the house, paperless, duplicate bill emailed, and a meter re-read request with morning visit. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. I just don't love getting a bill like this out of nowhere. Thanks for fixing it, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Thanks for calling, and happy new year in advance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
